[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0249","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0689","title":"Sun Common Desktop Environment dtspcd 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"CDE（Common Desktop Environment）的 dtspcd 守护进程存在符号链接攻击漏洞，本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接诱导 dtspcd 以高权限写入文件，从而覆盖系统关键文件或执行任意命令，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 CDE 2.1 及 Solaris 7.0 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至不受影响的版本或禁用 dtspcd 服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0689"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:51Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun 官方补丁 106577-01 (Solaris 7) 或 106578-01 (Solaris 7 x86)，升级 CDE 至修复版本。如无法打补丁，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释 dtspcd 行并重启 inetd 以禁用该服务，或限制 dtspcd 仅允许受信用户访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/192","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/636","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9909-103","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1880","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19498","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a3f034241443c2295538d03be5945be20fc1cca3/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0689.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0689","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0689.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a6294b4e43a4333eb79c2542461b42377b040bdc/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0689.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ec5a87b3406c3c1656cd4a2173d6654664bbeddf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wp6j-p4jf-4rwv/GHSA-wp6j-p4jf-4rwv.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com