，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，利用这些控件中的缓冲区溢出漏洞执行任意命令或创建修改文件。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/NT 4.0 等旧版系统上的 IE 浏览器，攻击无需任何身份认证，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1575"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:45Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-037 提供的补丁，升级至 Internet Explorer 5.01 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在 IE 安全设置中将\"ActiveX 控件和插件\"相关选项全部禁用，并将 Internet 区域安全级别设为\"高\"。对于仍在运行 Windows 95/NT 4.0 的系统，建议升级至受支持的 Windows 版本并使用现代浏览器以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/23412","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/24839","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/26924","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/41408","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/9162","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/28719","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-037","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7097","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19515","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1575.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1575","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1575.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2658816172d77941b1080be8784997934e564ee9/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1575.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-47wv-vjpm-2h95/GHSA-47wv-vjpm-2h95.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87944/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a79cec69-fa4e-4d67-8715-d3ad5c1620c5.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000770.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1194.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1194.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1194.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0309","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0702","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 导入导出收藏夹功能远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4.0.1/5.0/5.01 的\"导入/导出收藏夹\"功能存在代码注入漏洞（CWE-94）。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开或导入特制收藏夹文件（.html/.url 格式），利用 ImportExportFavorites 特性向目标系统写入恶意文件或直接执行任意代码，且代码以当前用户权限运行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低。受影响版本包括 IE 4.0.1、IE 5.0 和 IE 5.01，CVSS v2 评分为满分 10.0，危害等级严重。Microsoft 于 1999 年 9 月发布 MS99-037 安全公告及 KB241361 补丁修复该漏洞，建议受影响用户尽快升级 IE 至安全版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0702"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:52Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Internet Explorer 升级至 5.5 或以上版本（通过 Windows Update 安装 Microsoft 1999 年 11 月累积安全补丁），或安装对应安全更新。如暂无法升级，可在「Internet 选项 → 安全」中将 Internet 区域安全级别设为高，禁用「文件下载」与「运行 ActiveX 控件和插件」，并通过组策略限制 Favorites 导入导出功能，同时避免访问不可信网页作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ241361","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/627","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-037","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19490","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/32372dcb4b973a68d35643516e5e8206f397c85b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0702.json","https://gi