 升级至 2.0 或更高版本（该版本已修复路径遍历问题），或彻底移除该脚本并替换为现代文件下载方案。如无法升级，须在脚本中对 `f` 参数进行输入过滤，拒绝包含 `../`、`..\\` 或空字节的请求，并限制可访问目录范围。同时建议在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache 的 `mod_rewrite`）拦截包含 `..` 的 URL 请求作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://pulhas.org/phrack/55/P55-07.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1377.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1377","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1377.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1377.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fc4ea30e7f21aebcdcc3fac6ec198138ebd3f7f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q74x-f7gq-p3xf/GHSA-q74x-f7gq-p3xf.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1377.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000767.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0273","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0273.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0697","title":"SCO Doctor 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO Doctor 管理工具中存在权限提升漏洞，本地用户可通过该工具的 \"Tools\" 选项以 root 权限执行任意操作。攻击者需拥有系统本地访问权限，利用该漏洞可完全控制受影响系统，包括修改系统配置、访问敏感数据及安装恶意程序。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议用户限制本地用户对 SCO Doctor 工具的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0697"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:52Z","remediation":"升级 SCO OpenServer 至 5.0.5 及以上版本，或安装 SCO 官方安全补丁 erg712103。如无法升级，移除 SCO Doctor 的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /opt/K/SCO/Doctor/1.0.0/bin/doctor），并限制可登录系统的本地用户账号数量，仅保留管理员可交互登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/621","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d92a0abc5d3abac6dcdfabfef6fd71c158e0fd8b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0697.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0697","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0697.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/58eef6eedd760f280b47bfb4c94db9995b29c5a0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0697.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fwr5-hvj8-gff6/GHSA-fwr5-hvj8-gff6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0697.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6229833c-4cf2-4d79-b4d0-ced5f5ebb24d.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0273.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0482","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0482.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0767","title":"IBM AIX 与 Sun Solaris LC_MESSAGES libc 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris（7.0、2.6、SunOS 5.7）及 IBM AIX 4.2.1 的 C 语言标准库 libc 及配套工具（ufsrestore、rcp）在处理 LC_MESSAGES 环境变量时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户通过 telnetd 等远程登录服务连接到目标系统，且客户端传递了超长 LC_MESSAGES 环境变量值时，libc 在解析本地化消息时未对输入长度进行边界检查，导致栈缓冲区溢出，可被利用以覆盖返回地址执行任意代码。该漏洞在 setuid/setgid 程序（如 login）启动时同样可被本地攻击者触发，实现权限提升至 root。攻击者无需身份认证，只需建立网络连接并发送特制环境变量即可完成利用，CVSS v2 评分 7.2（HIGH），危害等级严重。Sun 及 IBM 已分别通过安全公告和补丁修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0767"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:00Z","remediation":"将 Sun Solaris 升级到 Solaris 7 的推荐补丁簇（如 105396 系列）或升级至 Solaris 8 及以上版本；IBM AIX 升级到 4.2.1 的官方补丁包（APAR IX####）或升级至 AIX 4.3 以上。临时缓解措施：取消普通用户对 ufsrestore、rcp 等 setuid 程序的执行权限（chmod u-s），并限制环境变量 LC_MESSAGES 的注入，通过应用供应商提供的 libc 环境变量过滤补丁修复缓冲区溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420557&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19217","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e244b55bdff85b2483c0e6a7cecd12f8bee0df6e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0767.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0767","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0767.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/70f84d5684ed60f7a4d0750993d15c30e4fe3bbf/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0767.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/958f1672375e115879b3a6bd13e3638812260c7d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w824-xcx7-fxrv/GHSA-w824-xcx7-fxrv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83063/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0767.json","https://github.com/oneaudit/openpoc/blob/31081b881c22c8096e0ee052413d10a2e364e1d3/stats/stats.go","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0482.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1070","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1353","title":"Nosque MsgCore 明文密码存储漏洞","description":"Nosque MsgCore 2.14 以明文形式存储密码：管理员密码存储在注册表 AdmPasswd 键中，用户密码存储在 Userbase.dbf 数据文件中。本地攻击者可读取这些明文凭据，进而获取系统未授权访问权限或提升权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1353"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"1999-09-07T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 MsgCore 到已修复此问题的版本；限制本地用户对注册表 AdmPasswd 键及 Userbase.dbf 文件的访问权限；对存储的密码进行加密处理以防明文泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T09:47:45Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93698162708211&w=2","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1353"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1185","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1185.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1562","title":"gFTP FTP客户端明文密码记录漏洞","description":"gFTP FTP 客户端 1.13 及 2.0.0 之前版本存在密码明文记录漏洞。程序在登录日志窗口或日志文件中以明文形式保存 FTP 账户密码，本地攻击者可通过读取日志文件或查看屏幕输出获取敏感凭据，进而接管 FTP 服务器。该漏洞源于开发者未对密码进行脱敏处理，影响范围广且利用简单，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1562"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:43Z","remediation":"升级到 gFTP 2.0.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复密码明文记录问题，密码不再显示在日志窗口和日志文件中。同时应检查并删除旧版本遗留的日志文件（通常位于 ~/.gftp/ 或临时目录下），避免其中残留的明文密码被本地低权限用户获取。如无法立即升级，可使用 `strace` 或类似工具确认当前 gFTP 行为，并避免在共享或多用户系统上使用低于 2.0.0 的版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-084","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/26915","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3446","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1562.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1562","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1562.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1562.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-084.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6prp-p499-7x8q/GHSA-6prp-p499-7x8q.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1562.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-084.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000764.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1185.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0725","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0725.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0925","title":"Messagemedia UnityMail 2.0 MIME Header 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Messagemedia UnityMail 2.0 邮件服务器在处理邮件 MIME 头部时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含大量 MIME 头部的特制邮件，导致邮件服务进程资源耗尽而崩溃，造成正常邮件收发功能中断。该漏洞影响 UnityMail 2.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0925"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:20Z","remediation":"该漏洞年代久远（1998年），厂商 Messagemedia 已停止支持 UnityMail 2.0，官方不再提供补丁。建议立即将 UnityMail 2.0 升级或迁移至受支持的邮件列表管理方案（如 Mailman 3 或 GNU Mailman）；若无法替换，在反向代理或防火墙上配置 HTTP 请求头数量限制（如限制单请求 MIME 头不超过 100 个），并限制管理 Web 端口的访问 IP 白名单作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90486243124867&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a662dc905cd549a2105daacbfce64cf01652761d/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0925.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0925","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0925.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/263f37bc67cd24fe03a39077d8b57f3001369a95/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0925.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2339193e1c10dc2db330718adeb8cc8d88c4dd/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4xw9-c2vm-jq79/GHSA-4xw9-c2vm-jq79.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0925.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1760/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0725.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0725.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1309","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0926","title":"Apache HTTP Server 1.2.5 MIME Header 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.2.5及更早版本在处理大量MIME头部时存在缺陷，远程攻击者可通过发送包含大量MIME头部的特制HTTP请求，导致服务器资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0926"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-09-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至Apache HTTP Server 1.3.0或更高版本，该版本修复了MIME头部处理中的拒绝服务问题。对于无法升级的旧系统，建议在反向代理层面限制单个请求的HTTP头部数量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T01:37:22Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1309.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1309.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1187","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1187.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1564","title":"FreeBSD NFS v3 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 3.2 及可能其他版本的 NFS v3 客户端实现中存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地用户可通过创建大量进程并发访问 NFS v3 挂载目录，触发内核 panic 导致系统崩溃。攻击者需具备本地 shell 访问权限，无需特殊权限即可利用，但无法实现提权或代码执行。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.2 及更早版本，属于本地拒绝服务类漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1564"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:43Z","remediation":"建议升级 FreeBSD 至 3.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复大量 NFS 并发访问导致的 panic 问题。如无法升级，可通过限制本地用户的进程数上限（在 /etc/login.conf 中设置 maxproc）来降低触发概率，并避免将 NFS v3 共享挂载点暴露给不可信本地用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/26166","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1564.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1564","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1564.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1564.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mqjc-cjrv-6894/GHSA-mqjc-cjrv-6894.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1564.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84436/info.html","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/75b00841a2a9a706d877d383325aa431229b4a9b/1999.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1148","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1148.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1516","title":"TenFour TFS Gateway SMTP 邮件服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"TenFour TFS Gateway SMTP 邮件服务器 3.2 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者通过向 SMTP 服务的 MAIL FROM 命令参数发送超过 128 字节的恶意数据，触发栈缓冲区溢出，可导致邮件服务崩溃甚至执行任意代码。攻击无需身份认证，仅需网络可达目标服务器的 25 端口即可实施远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1516"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:36Z","remediation":"立即将 TenFour TFS SMTP Server 升级至 4.0 或更高版本。由于该产品已停止维护且 Windows NT 平台已不再受支持，建议迁移至现代邮件服务器（如 Exchange Server、Postfix 或 hMailServer）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制仅信任网络可访问 TCP 25 端口，并对 SMTP MAIL FROM 命令输入长度实施网关级过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93677241318492&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4441343672f486c63736487674c197dfd2a4f256/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1516.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1516","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1516.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/33dc7d7c01654661dd82814415270cb51d2d0728/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1516.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db7261396795ee10e4834f0fdf94aec36b0936ff/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x657-67f8-62qq/GHSA-x657-67f8-62qq.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1516.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/T/tfs_smtp_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000762.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d1321841542ad681aa90ebf69f41b355bb7e4c9b/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1073","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1356","title":"Compaq Insight Manager agent Integration Maintenance Utility 安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"Compaq Insight Manager agent 中的 Compaq Integration Maintenance Utility 组件存在安全策略绕过漏洞。该工具可修改 Windows NT 系统的登录法律声明标题（LegalNoticeCaption）和文本（LegalNoticeText），攻击者利用此功能可篡改或移除系统登录前的法律提示信息，导致组织的安全策略无法正常执行。该漏洞影响 SmartStart 4.50 之前版本的 Compaq Insight Manager agent，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1356"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:15Z","remediation":"升级 Compaq Insight Manager agent 至 SmartStart 4.50 及以上版本，该版本修复了 Integration Maintenance Utility 可被用于修改 Windows NT 登录法律声明的问题。如无法升级，可通过组策略编辑器（gpedit.msc）锁定登录公告文字和标题的注册表项（HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Winlogon 下的 LegalNoticeCaption 和 LegalNoticeText），限制其写入权限为 SYSTEM 账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93646669500991&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93637792706047&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93759822830815&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7763.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1356.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1356","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1356.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16a13b6e06deb5f619f278e95f08ffda0e8f5a8e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1356.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p5mv-6mvr-j99h/GHSA-p5mv-6mvr-j99h.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87889/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1356.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/